@startuml
' Several transitions from a state to itself lie around one another, each
' with its own head, the words of each between it and the next.
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Idle : poll
Idle --> Idle : heartbeat [alive]
Idle --> Idle : retry
Idle --> Done : stop
state Outer {
  Inner --> Inner : a
  Inner --> Inner : b
}
Done --> Outer : again
Done --> Done : rest
@enduml
